{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Fisherman","text":"Hi! I don't get many visitors here!","uri":"098812119fe7bb39edc9356a6f171b12.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Fisherman","text":"Just ring one of the bells outside.","uri":"3cb0258745e8ae401f9578f85c0a74d1.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Fisherman","text":"Not amazing. Not many fish can live in this gungey stuff. I remember when this was a pleasant river teeming with every sort of fish...","uri":"fe53407590cf23c22a8bfd86bce6e1e8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Fisherman","text":"This place used to be very beautiful, however, as our king grows old and weak, the land seems to be dying too.","uri":"553c942362f96ed0476e632c66f8a592.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Fisherman","text":"Why, that's easy!","uri":"0060b0b6e298fef00d36a675a84c07d0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Fisherman","text":"You must be blind then. There's ALWAYS bells there when I go to the castle.","uri":"142c6cd45cf6078c78b649143ead4710.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"High Priest","text":"Many greetings. Welcome to our fair island.","uri":"72591c25fe6a4b1454d2e4a6f08cc8b6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"High Priest","text":"Nor do I really care.","uri":"32bbb4042c6fa9301d7e584cfc4a900f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"High Priest","text":"The object of which you speak did once pass through holy Entrana. I know not where it is now however.","uri":"5b2da00c5854d83d07d347782441e2e0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Ah yes. I remember young Percival. He rode off on a quest a couple of months ago. We are getting a bit worried, he's not back yet...","uri":"fa5771b5837943d14786be39f03ddcc9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Aha! I'm glad you are here! I am sending out various knights on an important quest. I was wondering if you too would like to take up this quest?","uri":"46c893e04cd67034a436740adb070277.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"As I said before, speak to Merlin in the workshop by the library.","uri":"a43006ce1aabffc27fe31d01cedab0ea.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Be sure that you come speak to me soon then.","uri":"dcc938aaabfd7fc3a1a551d683779e3d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Free up some space and I'll give you a feather.","uri":"a5490fe38d76c5c249d7b67a861b5237.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Go speak to Merlin. He may be able to give a better clue as to where it is now you have freed him from that crystal.","uri":"f6efce8445529d45519d26cab2397a9e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"He has set up his workshop in the room next to the library.","uri":"927443f20c31170a67ed120a65d30bb3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"He was going to try and recover the golden boots of Arkaneeses.","uri":"56dfe5d1efc64838fd4f56acce341fe0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"How goes thy quest?","uri":"74d3b20c0a3bc15ec1884ba133aa8212.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Just blowing gently on them will supposedly show the way to go.","uri":"dadca772f4823a8df0bddef78bba84f9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Maybe later then?","uri":"464ffcba01a1a6d14c962b325dd27e63.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"None of my knights ever did return with it last time. Now we have the opportunity to give it another go, maybe this time we will have more luck!","uri":"5525d0adaab01fed50e671940dbf826d.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Not exactly. We discovered some magic golden feathers that are said to point the way to the boots...","uri":"79f48dac1c74825e13237532225b4e35.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Thank you for retrieving the Grail! You shall be long remembered as one of the greatest heroes amongst the Knights of the Round Table!","uri":"48e3259a184cc7f5af1556b82fb63cf2.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"They certainly point somewhere.","uri":"5fb57e7937c20361ae964f1e014e08d6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"This is most fortuitous!","uri":"f1a6238434719cb91296642fe935e163.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Well, the Grail IS very elusive, it may take some perseverance.","uri":"ccda6206db49a15e3dd3ba092b859f55.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Well, we recently found out that the Holy Grail has passed into Gielinor.","uri":"1fd6a48dd912c8b8da9b5d1654b701ac.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"King Arthur","text":"Wow! Incredible! You truly are a splendid knight!","uri":"430e8c11035d81b3ba9a7453ce2a9302.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Merlin","text":"Ah yes... the Holy Grail...","uri":"45cea6fcfb8b9b1b9847619c40b4c369.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Merlin","text":"Congratulations, brave knight, on aiding Camelot in so many ways! If we ever require help again, I will make sure to call upon you!","uri":"80f993a2ebce9ec781b6450ae1a4f007.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Merlin","text":"Due to its nature the Holy Grail is likely to reside in a holy place.","uri":"c04418bffb17722c9f58da8e53904472.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Merlin","text":"Galahad now lives a life of religious contemplation. He lives somewhere west of McGrubor's Wood I think.","uri":"76f592004e14027b078ee26497cd9890.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Merlin","text":"He returned from the quest many years after everyone else. He seems to know something about it, but he can only speak about those experiences cryptically.","uri":"f506bb775cfa12f50bca6e77240889e3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Merlin","text":"I believe there is a holy island somewhere not far away... I'm not entirely sure... I spent too long inside that crystal! Anyway, go and talk to someone over there.","uri":"0294c8da2e1e95789a3e96bedfccc6a7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Holy Grail","character":"Merlin","text":"I suppose you could also try speaking to Sir Galahad?","uri":"7b97d2b33bae7c623671a9d5b3e7a8a6.mp3"}
